## Architecture Pattern
```
fdny.exe:
- Registers entity classnames (12-byte factories)
- Receives void* pointers from engine
- Passes pointers to genesis.dll functions
- NEVER accesses entity members directly

genesis.dll:
- Defines actual entity structures
- Implements all geVec3d operations
- Contains bounds checking code
- Manages entity memory
```

